<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_66b005a6484e5a6e96e40015102d69efc8bc0d0cc9a2a807f86d748d49b3068d_n0021/e_0001/normalization> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/EntityNormalization> .
