<http://digistrucmed.org/grade-record/lu_66b005a6484e5a6e96e40015102d69efc8bc0d0cc9a2a807f86d748d49b3068d_n0021/gr_0005> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasGradeValue> <http://digistrucmed.org/ClassOfRecommendation_1> .
